  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Hei Cheng sends Xue Song Zi after the immortal zombie and the rank six Gu Immortal, Xue Song Zi closes above Fang Yuan and pushes both hands into this killer move at once with Ice Mountain Awl and Snow Sparrow Crisis. All three are attack type casts; in that volley intense wind and snow fill the air, snowflakes gather into thousands of birds that move through the storm, and twenty to thirty mountain-sized spiked icicles fly to pierce Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan answers with myriad self: wherever the army goes, ice mountains collapse, snow sparrows cry, and the snow stops.",
